#. Tag: title
#: about.docbook:8
#, no-c-format
msgid "About this <acronym>FAQ</acronym>"
msgstr "Acerca desta <acronym>FAQ</acronym>"

#. Tag: para
#: about.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "What can I do to help out with this <acronym>FAQ</acronym>?"
msgstr "Que podo facer para axudar con estas <acronym>FAQ</acronym>?"

#. Tag: para
#: about.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First, send us any errors that you may find. Also, any suggestions that you "
"might have, are appreciated. Better yet, send us everything that you think "
"is unclear, and if possible, send us what you think would be a clearer "
"solution. The email address of the current maintainer is <email>jhall@kde."
"org</email>."
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, comuníquenos calquera erro que atope. Tamén se estimará calquera "
"suxestión que poda facernos. Mellor aínda, comuníquenos todo aquelo que "
"pense que non está claro, e se é posíbel, tamén o que pensa que sería unha "
"solución mellor. O enderezo de correo do mantenedor actual é "
"<email>jhall@kde.org</email>."

#. Tag: para
#: about.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Second, send us your solutions of those frequently-asked questions which are "
"still not in this <acronym>FAQ</acronym>. We will put them in as soon as "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"Segundo, envíenos solucións para esas perguntas que se fan con frecuencia "
"que aínda non aparezan nesta <acronym>FAQ</acronym>. Engadirémolas tan axiña "
"como sexa posíbel."

#. Tag: para
#: about.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Last but not least, please make full use of this <acronym>FAQ</acronym>. "
"Read this <acronym>FAQ</acronym> (and other relevant documentation) well "
"before asking questions on the various &kde; mailing lists or newsgroups."
msgstr ""
"Por último,  faga uso destas <acronym>FAQ</acronym>. Léaas ben antes de "
"facer calquera pergunta nas listas de correo de &kde; ou nos grupos de novas."

#. Tag: para
#: about.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You might also want to consider becoming a <acronym>FAQ</acronym> "
"maintainer. Please refer to <xref linkend=\"FAQ-maintainer-HOWTO\"/> for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"Tamén pode interesarlle converterse nun mantenedor das <acronym>FAQ</"
"acronym>. Consulte <xref linkend=\"FAQ-maintainer-HOWTO\"/> para coñecer "
"máis detalles."

#. Tag: para
#: about.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I become a <acronym>FAQ</acronym> maintainer?"
msgstr "Como me podo converter nun mantenedor das <acronym>FAQ</acronym>?"

#. Tag: para
#: about.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Actually, it is very easy to become an <acronym>FAQ</acronym> maintainer, "
"and we are always in need of fresh blood. :-) Just send us an email at "
"<email>kde-doc-english@kde.org</email>."
msgstr ""
"É moi sinxelo facerse mantenedor das <acronym>FAQ</acronym>, sempre se "
"precisa sangue nova. :-) Simplesmente envíe un correo electrónico a "
"<email>kde-doc-english@kde.org</email>."
